  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and Inclusive Water Access for Refugees and Host Communities in Turkana West Project - (SIWA Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide support to the transition process towards Government of Kenya -led basic social services in water. In consultation with the county water department, investments in infrastructure to increase access to safe and affordable water and sanitation for communities, public primary schools, and health facilities through solarized boreholes (new &amp; rehabilitated); sand dams; water purification; &amp; sanitation, and hygiene promotion will be provided.

This project was co-created with the Turkana County water department and will support a stepwise transition towards increasing County government responsibility for provision of WASH service to refugees and host communities in Turkana.</narrative>
  </description>
